  "whatKombienStoresBody": "No account, no name, no phone number. A fare report is a route, a price, the time, and optional details (weather, vehicle). Each phone signs in anonymously so spam can be stopped, never to follow anyone. Only route averages are ever shown, and only once enough riders reported a route. Saved places, your language and your settings stay on this phone.",
